            that was already open. <b>Transparent</b> drops the background of the button, <b>NoShadow</b> drops the
            box-shadow of the callout, and <b>FullWidth</b> stretches the button to the available width.
        </div>
        <br />
        <BitDropMenu Text="Basic">
            <BitStack Gap="0.5rem" Style="padding:0.5rem">
