            edge given by <b>PanelPosition</b> and is swiped away along the same axis it slid in on: sideways for
            <b>Start</b> and <b>End</b>, up or down for <b>Top</b> and <b>Bottom</b>. Point <b>ScrollContainerId</b> at
            the scrollable element inside the content so the swipe gesture does not fight its scrolling. Resize the
            window to see it.
        </div>
        <br />
        <BitDropMenu Text="End PanelPosition" Responsive ScrollContainerId="sc-con1" PanelPosition="BitSide.End">
            <div style="max-width:200px;overflow:auto" id="sc-con1">
                <BitStack FitWidth Gap="0.5rem" Style="padding:0.5rem">
